m/godotengine/godot/pull/115329.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115329.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"After the restructuring of Godot’s editor/ code in version 4.5, the editor/inspector/ directory now houses all inspector-related widgets, while editor/settings/ contains code pertaining to EditorSettings and ProjectSettings.\r\n\r\nHowever, editor/inspector/editor_sectioned_inspector is exclusively used by EditorSettings and ProjectSettings. For better code organization and adherence to the project’s directory structure, this file should be moved to the editor/settings/ directory. This PR also removes some unnecessary editor_sectioned_inspector include statements.\r\n\r\nThis is my first time contributing to the Godot community, and I would be honored if this PR is accepted.\r\n\r\nI suspect the confusion stems from the filename editor_sectioned_inspector, which does not clearly reflect its actual purpose. I suggest renaming it to either editor_settings_browser or editor_settings_explorer. I am happy to implement this renaming in the same PR if the suggestion is approved.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115329/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115329/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}